Withdraw_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the admin
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller is the admin
    ├── when the amount is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the amount is not zero
        ├── given winners are owed
        │   └── it should revert
        └── given nobody is owed
            ├── when free money would fall below the floor
            │   └── it should revert
            └── when free money stays at or above the floor
                ├── when the open bets' max profit would be left uncovered
                │   └── it should revert
                └── when the open bets stay covered
                    ├── when seed recovery would pass 500 whole tokens
                    │   └── it should revert
                    └── when the withdrawal is within every limit
                        ├── when the transfer to the recipient fails
                        │   └── it should revert
                        └── when the transfer succeeds
                            ├── it should take the amount out of the pool total
                            ├── it should add it to the purpose's counter
                            ├── it should send it to the purpose's recipient
                            └── it should emit {PoolWithdrawn}
